  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given set of equations are:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p>Now on solving the above equation by taking two at a time and plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0052_cfae8ea7e2bd.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 171px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>The required equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
